    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Peacekeeper's Poise.</strong> Your presence steadies people at the exact moment everything could go sideways.</p><ul><li>When initiative is rolled, you can choose up to a number of creatures equal to your Presence modifier (minimum one) within 6 squares of you. Each gains temporary Integrity equal to your Presence modifier + your tier.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your tier.</li></ul>",
